{"id": "swebq0198", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3881501288, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "452ae3d391103874253b2612ca88a459fb34e3c2c0d46a5f0ea415086d584f74", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "what celebrities has brody jenner dated?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0198.wav", "input_sha256": "7ea1d4e9c8aa4f1d8670234d52f09534dc2f5aedaca3e44b4b7ffe87bdee9a11", "input_samples": 42335, "input_s": 2.646, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.8718, "act": 0.9991, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Brody Jenner’s publicly reported dating history includes: Kristin Cavallari — dated around 2005–2006. (glamour.com) , Nicole Richie — briefly dated in 2006. (glamour.com) , Lauren Conrad — appeared as a romance on The Hills, though Brody later said it was not real / was fabricated. (eonline.com) , Jayde Nicole — Playboy model and The Hills cast member; dated during the show era..", "expert_answer": "Brody Jenner’s publicly reported dating history includes:\n\n- **Kristin Cavallari** — dated around **2005–2006**. ([glamour.com](https://www.glamour.com/story/brody-jenner-ex-girlfriends?utm_source=openai))  \n- **Nicole Richie** — briefly dated in **2006**. ([glamour.com](https://www.glamour.com/story/brody-jenner-ex-girlfriends?utm_source=openai))  \n- **Lauren Conrad** — appeared as a romance on *The Hills*, though Brody later said it was **not real / was fabricated**. ([eonline.com](https://www.eonline.com/ca/news/557073/brody-jenner-admits-he-never-dated-lauren-conrad?utm_source=openai))  \n- **Jayde Nicole** — Playboy model and *The Hills* cast member; dated during the show era. ([en.wikipedia.org](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_The_Hills_cast_members?utm_source=openai))  \n- **Avril Lavigne** — dated from about **2010 to 2012**. ([en.wikipedia.org](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brody_Jenner?utm_source=openai))  \n- **Kaitlynn Carter** — dated beginning around **2013**; they had a Bali ceremony in 2018 but were reportedly not legally married in the U.S.; split in 2019. ([tmz.com](https://www.tmz.com/2025/07/13/brody-jenner-marries-tia-blanco/?utm_source=openai))  \n- **Josie Canseco** — short romance after his split from Carter. ([eonline.com](https://www.eonline.com/news/1419822/brody-jenner-marries-tia-blanco-the-hills-love-lives-now?utm_source=openai))  \n- **Briana Jungwirth** — reported relationship in **2020**. ([whosdatedwho.com](https://www.whosdatedwho.com/dating/brody-jenner?utm_source=openai))  \n- **Tia Blanco** — began dating in **2022**, got engaged in 2023, and married on **July 12, 2025**. ([en.wikipedia.org](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tia_Blanco?utm_source=openai))  \n\nHe has also been **rumored** to have had flings with **Paris Hilton** and **Haylie Duff**, but those are less firmly confirmed. ([glamour.com](https://www.glamour.com/story/brody-jenner-ex-girlfriends?utm_source=openai))", "transcript": "What celebrities has Brody Jenner dated?\n", "asr_s": 1.15, "expert_s": 13.75, "expert_input_samples": 42335, "expert_input_s": 2.646, "expert_input_sha256": "7ea1d4e9c8aa4f1d8670234d52f09534dc2f5aedaca3e44b4b7ffe87bdee9a11", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 7.875, "relay_synth_ms": 12946, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 7, "feed_lag_max_ms": 507, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 630, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0198_balanced_relay.wav", "sha256": "e9d1a759d5bde01fd40a7f1ee205da6f84019cc68f8395accef3fd7c96cf751d", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 30.52}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0198_balanced_candidate.wav", "sha256": "e1cced2d7059f754861b75e35d1afc87099b5b285cf1d03e522a7c069211984a", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/d